## Object Destructuring

Object destructuring allows extracting values from objects into variables.

# Without Destructuring

let student = {
    name: "Sudarshan",
    age: 21
};

let name = student.name;
let age = student.age;

console.log(name);
console.log(age);



# With Destructuring
File Name: objectDestructuring.js
let student = {
    name: "Sudarshan",
    age: 21
};

let { name, age } = student;

console.log(name);
console.log(age);

Output
Sudarshan
21